## Pan-cancer spatial atlas of tertiary lymphoid structures

**DOI:** https://doi.org/10.1126/science.adz2742

A study constructing a pan-cancer atlas of tertiary lymphoid structures (TLSs) using spatial transcriptomics and artificial intelligence (AI)-based pathology analysis. The work shows that TLS maturation state, cellular organization, and spatial location influence antitumor immunity and clinical outcomes across multiple cancer types.

**Keywords:** Spatial Transcriptomics, Tertiary Lymphoid Structures, Tumor Immunology, Spatial Biology, AI Pathology, Cancer
